Source of the package vignette.

The vignette is shipped as a pre-built PDF through the R.rsp::asis engine
(vignettes/vignette.pdf and vignette.pdf.asis), so R CMD build and CRAN
checks do not run the model fits. This folder is excluded from the build
(.Rbuildignore).

To rebuild after changing the package or the text, with the package
installed:

    cd vignettes/source
    R CMD Sweave usingSTS.Rnw        # runs the code, writes usingSTS.tex
    pdflatex usingSTS && pdflatex usingSTS
    cp usingSTS.pdf ../usingSTS.pdf
    cd .. && make                    # compresses it into ../inst/doc/vignette.pdf
    cp ../inst/doc/vignette.pdf vignette.pdf

The fits take about a minute on one thread.
